# --- Captured sensor data. Never commit. -------------------------------------
# add_metadata() writes GPS and IMU into the EXIF of every optical frame when
# GPS is active, so a capture is location data, not just an image. These paths
# are untracked today and this keeps a stray `git add -A` from changing that.
images/
**/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-*-NIR-ON.jpg
**/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-*-NIR-OFF.jpg
**/lepton_*.pgm
**/temperatures_*.csv
**/final_5_band*.tiff
**/color_preserved_5_band*.tiff
**/*_segmentation.png
registration_transform.json
registration_transform.tfm
